  m_text: In this game you will need to match your planes to the color of the enemy
    aircraft. Tap on your plane to change its color. Red planes are effective against
    green ones, green planes are effective against blue ones, blue planes are effective
    against red ones. You will need to show your skills in order to have time to
    fight the enemy, but you will cope! Good luck!
